      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating Translation Script**\n\nI'm working on the Python script, `batch_translate.py`, to translate a list of strings, keeping the original order. I've decided to use Google Translate as the external provider. This should be explicitly stated within the code for clarity and maintainability.\n\n\n**Defining Translation Process**\n\nI've firmed up the core structure. The script, `batch_translate.py`, will leverage the Google Cloud Translation API. My initial function will handle a list of strings, the target language, and an optional source language. The essential bit is ensuring the translated strings retain their original sequence. The plan is in place to integrate the Google Cloud client library directly.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819669496,
          "start": 1789819667159
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b990c2d70016s3cjbSYyn7M1v",
