        "text": "**Confirming Progress with API**\n\nI've successfully created the `batch_translate.py` script. It's using the Google Cloud Translation API via the `google.cloud.translate_v3beta1` import and the `translate.TranslationServiceClient()`. This confirms the translation service provider. The script now incorporates the `batch_translate` function as requested, allowing batch translations.\n\n\n**Validating Batch Functionality**\n\nI've finalized the `batch_translate.py` script, ensuring full Google Cloud Translation API integration with the requested features. The `batch_translate_text` function handles a string list, providing batch translations in the same order. I believe all the initial requirements have been addressed.\n\n\n",
