      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Translation Provider**\n\nI've decided to use the Google Cloud Translation API for the Python script. I will need to make the provider choice clear within the `translate_text.py` file. I'm focusing on how best to integrate this choice into the code's structure and any required API key management.\n\n\n**Implementing Translation Script**\n\nI'm now building the `translate_text.py` script. The plan is to have a function that handles text translation between languages, leveraging the Google Cloud Translation API. I'm focusing on incorporating the API's client initialization and ensuring the function properly handles inputs for the text, source, and target languages. I am focusing on implementation details.\n\n\n",
